DynaMoe is an independent derivative project built on the open-source oMLX
runtime. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the oMLX
project or its maintainers.

Major DynaMoe modifications include scope-aware DeepSeek V4 expert banks,
dynamic MoE cache policies, lossy expert replacement experiments, expert-store
I/O, session-aware scope selection, observability, and product/API surfaces.

